===Etymology 2===
{{wp|+ (surname)}}
Various origins:
* Borrowed from {{bor|en|nl|-}} and {{bor|en|de|Bank||bench}}, a metonymic occupational surname for someone who worked with a bench or counter, like a money changer.
* Borrowed from {{bor|en|da|-}} and {{bor|en|sv|Bank}}, a topographic surname from {{m|sv|bank||sandbank}} or, alternatively, a nickname for a loud an noisy person, from {{m|sv|bank||noise}}.

